#: ../../source/api/tree/general.rst:12 fadd90ef4aa842f4a8c03ee87977287f
msgid ""
"The Tree class implements a general tree (n-ary tree) where each node can"
" have an arbitrary number of children. This provides maximum flexibility "
"for representing hierarchical data such as file systems, organizational "
"charts, and XML/HTML documents."
msgstr ""

